{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415736","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415736","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041573601:1":{"text":"따뜻한 음료? 거슬리는군...","source_cn":"加热的饮品？真是惹人心烦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCC02F36A60005FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041573602:1":{"text":"흠... 왜 그렇게 몸을 웅크리고 있지? 마치 눈보라에 갇힌 아기새 같군.","source_cn":"呵，你怎么是一副蜷缩的模样，像只被暴雪困住的雏鸟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FEFCEF81EBFC781","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041573603:1":{"text":"내, 혀가... 곧 발에 닿을 것 같은데...","source_cn":"这、这位……女士，我的舌头，快要砸到脚上了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF74C2FB28A40FE83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041573604:1":{"text":"이 빌어먹을 날씨... 후... 아, 무래도 대화는... 여기까지 해야...","source_cn":"鬼天气……呼……差不多，该……该结束谈话了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF72BB28E487DC3F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041573605:1":{"text":"이렇게 빨리?","source_cn":"这么快就要结束了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA115E6CC6315EE79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041573606:1":{"text":"설마 이렇게 뼈가 시리도록 상쾌한데, 춥다고 불만인 건 아니지?","source_cn":"这恰到好处的清凉，难道会让你感到不适吗，亲爱的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3EC0FC39C2DFC69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041573607:1":{"text":"보렴. 네가 내뿜는 하얀 입김조차 내 손바닥 위에서 춤추고 있지 않니. 우리의 게임은 이제 막 시작인걸.","source_cn":"你看，连你呼出的白雾都在我的掌心跳舞，我们的游戏才刚刚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x782ECB83BA28AED7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041573608:1":{"text":"후... 그렇다면... 변신한 뒤에... 천천히 대화를...","source_cn":"呼……既然这样……变……变形之后……我们慢慢聊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA81909DCB8F04912","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041573609:1":{"text":"이제 훨씬 따뜻해졌군. 얼어붙은 몸이 통째로 온천에 들어간 것처럼, 드디어 머리가 돌아가기 시작했어.","source_cn":"现在暖和多了，感觉像是把冻僵的思路一下子扔进了温泉里，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F165B6FAC73157B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041573610:1":{"text":"좋아, 얼음의 숙녀. 아까 말하려던 게 얼음 바람이었나?","source_cn":"好了，冰霜女士，你刚才想说冰风还是什么来着？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x292A2BF814557679","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041573611:1":{"text":"오? 겉모습뿐 아니라 생명의 본질적 기운까지 완전히 변했군. 참으로 정교한 변신술이야.","source_cn":"哦？不仅仅是外表的改变，连生命的本质气息都彻底转换了。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B0169FDA55E7C87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041573612:1":{"text":"나라면 아름다운 육체들을 얼려버린 뒤에, 그 모습으로 변신할 텐데.","source_cn":"若我能掌握这般技艺，冻僵那些美妙的躯体，再变形为他们的模样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE40972DBF328FBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041573613:1":{"text":"그렇게 하면 그 육체를 영원히 대체할 수 있겠지. 질리면 다른 몸으로 바꾸면 되고... 그게 더 재미있지 않겠어?","source_cn":"呵，这样一来，便能永久地取代他们，要是倦了，便换下一具...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8965D435A5EB1469","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041573614:1":{"text":"단단히 착각하고 있군. 변신술의 핵심은 이해와 조화지, 억지로 껍데기만 뒤집어쓰는 게 아니야.","source_cn":"我想你误入了歧途，变形术的关键在于理解与和谐，而不是粗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFECEFEA6039B0B62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041573615:1":{"text":"네가 집착하는 지배란, 그저 세상에 잔혹한 족쇄를 채우는 것에 불과하지.","source_cn":"你迷恋的掌控，不过是给世界套上残忍的镣铐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x240315FAA0BC34AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041573616:1":{"text":"족쇄? 흥, 만물은 얼어붙을 때에야 비로소 가장 순수한 본질을 드러내는 법이지.","source_cn":"镣铐？呵，冰晶凝结时，万物才会呈现出更纯粹的本质。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C7D8C2FDAB0C4C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041573617:1":{"text":"마치 지금처럼 말이야. 네 눈동자 속에 일렁이는 그 불꽃도, 주변의 한기 덕분에 이토록 찬란하게 빛나는 것 아니겠어?","source_cn":"就像此刻，你瞳孔里跳动的火焰，不正因为周围的寒意才显得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5371805BD894EF03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041573618:1":{"text":"그 말대로라면 개구리를 얼음 속에 얼려두는 것도 본질을 드러낸다고 할 수 있겠군? 그건 그저 가장 비참한 순간을 고정해 둔 것뿐이야.","source_cn":"照你这么说，把青蛙冻在冰里也能算揭示本质？那不过是定格...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x554BEC46FB7E5B5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1041573619:1":{"text":"진정한 “본질”은 나무뿌리처럼 따뜻한 흙이 있어야 싹을 틔우는 법이야. 진열장 속 표본처럼 쳐다보라고 있는 게 아니라고.","source_cn":"真正的本质像树根，需要温暖的土壤才能向上生长，而不是被...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0AA1338AD6AF637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1041573620:1":{"text":"어리석은 짐승 같으니. 됐다, 더 말해봐야 입만 아프겠군.","source_cn":"呵，愚笨的动物，罢了，多费口舌。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x680BCE8845F1B83D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","do